"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">11845</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">862/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/16/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/16/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">SSG104</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Communication and In-Group Working Skills_Kỹ năng giao tiếp và cộng tác</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 0.5 hour final exam + 104.5 hours self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Presenting,Project based learning,Social Constructivism,Student-centered theory</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">11845</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">862/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/16/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/16/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This course covers both working in groups and communication skills. The course covers theories of communication, working in group, and activities for students to practice applying the theories in academic and working contexts.</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>Progress marks:<br><br>- 03 Activity: 15% (5% each activity)<br><br>- 02 Group Assignment: 20% (10% each assignment)<br><br>- 01 Participation: 10%<br><br>- 01 Quiz: 5%<br><br>- 01 Group Project: 30% (part 1: proposal, part 2: product, part 3: presentation/report; 10% each)<br><br>- 01 Final exam: 20%<br><br>Conditions to pass: Final exam &gt;= 4<br><br>Grade Average &gt;= 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This course covers both working in groups and communication skills. The course covers theories of communication, working in group, and activities for students to practice applying the theories in academic and working contexts.</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>Progress marks:<br><br>- 03 Activity: 15% (5% each activity)<br><br>- 02 Group Assignment: 20% (10% each assignment)<br><br>- 01 Participation: 10%<br><br>- 01 Quiz: 5%<br><br>- 01 Group Project: 30% (part 1: proposal, part 2: product, part 3: presentation/report; 10% each)<br><br>- 01 Final exam: 20%<br><br>Conditions to pass: Final exam &gt;= 4<br><br>Grade Average &gt;= 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11845\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11845</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11845\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11845</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
